\f0\fs32 \cf0 Welcome to the Bookish alpha.\
\
This is an early release, is unfinished, and will have bugs. \
\
The user interface is not polished, and may not always be intuitive at this stage. Use your imagination, and watch out for splinters...\
\
I am interested in hearing about the problems you encounter. Please do let me know what doesn't work for you, or what you think I need to change or add. It might be on my list already, but it might not.\
\
